  <section class="cv-sec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">ISSUES</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">我關心的議題</h2></div>
  <div class="cv-chips"><span class="cv-chip off">文化與地方認同</span><span class="cv-chip off">健康與社會福利</span><span class="cv-chip off">環境與能源</span><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/traffic/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M184,32H72a8,8,0,0,0-8,8V216a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H184a8,8,0,0,0,8-8V40A8,8,0,0,0,184,32ZM128,192a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,192Zm0-80a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,112Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M128,56a32,32,0,1,0,32,32A32,32,0,0,0,128,56Zm0,48a16,16,0,1,1,16-16A16,16,0,0,1,128,104Zm0,32a32,32,0,1,0,32,32A32,32,0,0,0,128,136Zm0,48a16,16,0,1,1,16-16A16,16,0,0,1,128,184Zm88-40H200V80h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H200V40a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,40V64H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H56v64H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H56v56a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H184a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V160h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16Zm-32,72H72V40H184V216Z"/></svg>交通與通勤安全</a><span class="cv-chip off">勞動與在地經濟</span></div>
</div></section>
  
  <section class="cv-sec cv-fellowsec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">TEAM</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">看看<span class="u">台灣前進的夥伴</span></h2></div>
